    d="M19.95 9.47368V8.42105H18.9V7.36842H17.85V6.31579H16.8V5.26316H15.75V4.21053H14.7V3.15789H13.65V2.10526H12.6V1.05263H11.55V0H10.5V9.47368V10.5263V20H11.55V18.9474H12.6V17.8947H13.65V16.8421H14.7V15.7895H15.75V14.7368H16.8V13.6842H17.85V12.6316H18.9V11.5789H19.95V10.5263H21V9.47368H19.95Z"
